Age of deceased on basis for applying multiplier; (D) Reasonable figures on conventional heads,
namely, loss of estate, loss of consortium and funeral expenses, with escalation; (E) Future prospects for all categories of persons and for different ages: with permanent job; self-employed or fixed salary.
